      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احنط</span></b> : see 1, in five places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْنَطَهُ</span>: and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْنِطَ</span>: see 2. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The former also signifies <i>He,</i> or
<i>it, made him,</i> or <i>it, to bleed: made him,</i> or <i>it, to
be bloody;</i> or <i>smeared, befouled,</i> or <i>defiled, him,</i>
or <i>it, with blood: it</i> (blood) <i>befouled,</i> or <i>defiled,
him,</i> or <i>it.</i> (IAar.)

